@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A block comment on its own line between a decorator and an `async`, modifier or generator method stays between them (tests/format/typescript/comments/16889.ts) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 Line comments and same-line block comments next to a decorator keep their place, and a comment before an undecorated abstract method is unchanged (tests/format/typescript/comments/16889.ts) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Attach an own-line comment after a decorator of a class member to the decorator, as a line comment already is, and declare the placement on the comment context (src/language-js/comments/handle-comments.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Add the changelog entry (changelog_unreleased/typescript/16891.md)
